It's going to combine together as well.

00:03:26.475 --> 00:03:27.635
So it's BA.

00:03:28.075 --> 00:03:31.225
Now we always swap,
drop, and check charges.

00:03:31.515 --> 00:03:35.264
So it's a two plus on
barium, one minus on nitrate.

00:03:35.904 --> 00:03:39.364
Um, so when we are doing that,
we got to swap, drop everything.

00:03:39.374 --> 00:03:40.644
Same with H and OH.

00:03:41.014 --> 00:03:43.325
They're plus and minus one,
so they're already balanced.

00:03:43.915 --> 00:03:46.585
So we balance that, we do our swap, drop.

00:03:46.955 --> 00:03:51.075
Now the thing is we have to make
