00:04:24.805 --> 00:04:27.564
putting a 2 out in front of nitrate.

00:04:28.254 --> 00:04:32.455
Now like, this method is what I refer
to as a zigzag method, so being that

00:04:32.455 --> 00:04:37.415
we have Two nitrates, we'll look at
hydrogen, so there's two on the left,

00:04:38.115 --> 00:04:39.385
how many do I have on the right?

00:04:39.515 --> 00:04:44.625
Well, being that we separated H and OH
