00:04:48.715 --> 00:04:55.195
right, and we'll We'll then zigzag to
our OH, and we'll look, we have two

00:04:55.205 --> 00:04:59.505
hydroxides on the right, and we also
have two on the right, on the left.

00:04:59.954 --> 00:05:02.015
This is a balanced chemical reaction.

00:05:03.115 --> 00:05:07.444
Alright, so now that we have
