00:05:20.760 --> 00:05:23.690
what exactly are we being given.

00:05:24.310 --> 00:05:28.990
So in this problem, the first thing
that we have is that we have 0.

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:33.779
45 molar of HNO3.

00:05:34.209 --> 00:05:37.090
And then we were also given
what the concentration and

00:05:37.090 --> 00:05:38.949
volume was of barium hydroxide.

00:05:38.950 --> 00:05:41.020
So we have 0.

00:05:41.020 --> 00:05:43.529
245 molar of barium hydroxide.

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:47.419
And it has a volume of 27.

00:05:47.520 --> 00:05:49.629
2 milliliters.

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:52.390
So, why do we do this?

00:05:52.400 --> 00:05:55.380
It's because it helps tell you
